attribution.description:
Photo montage of Versailles
<p>From top left to bottom right: 
</p><p><i>Le Soir</i> ("The Evening" in the gardens of Versailles); <i>rue des Deux-Portes</i>; the <i>Château de Versailles</i> taken from the gardens; 
</p><p>Versailles Cathedral; equestrian statue of Louis XIV, <i>place d'Armes</i>, in front of the Château; Church of Notre-Dame, Versailles, parish church of the Château; 
</p><p>the <i>bassin d'Apollon</i> in the gardens of Versailles; 
</p>
<i>La salle du Jeu de paume</i> (where the Tennis Court Oath was signed); the <i>Musée Lambinet</i> (municipal museum of Versailles); the <i>Temple de l'Amour</i> ("Temple of Love", garden of the <i>Petit Trianon</i>)
